      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SceneRef - Studio: movie with voices (MiniMax H3)\n\n1. SceneRef Resolution and the Viewer: open a scene, frame the shot (mannequins optional).\n2. Character node: the person's face photo, a full body photo and a voice recording (Load Audio, 5 to 30 s of clear speech, no music). Add more Load Image nodes into face / body / outfit for more photos; chain more Character nodes through 'cast' for more people, or use the Cast list on the Studio (.char / RefMod files, + voice per person).\n   The Character node's text box shows which pictures are used and what looks wrong (no face, blurred, someone else, the same photo twice). Small faces are cropped to the face; nothing is enlarged.\n3. Studio: create = movie. Write the action with quoted speech ('Emma says: \"...\"'), press 'Write the prompt', read it, Run.\n   A voice is only used for someone who speaks: the prompt then says '<Audio 1> is Emma's voice'. Delete that sentence to let H3 invent the voice.\n4. Preview & Save shows the clip (MP4 with sound)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "SceneRef - Studio: movie with voices (MiniMax H3)\n\n1. SceneRef Resolution and the Viewer: open a scene, frame the shot (mannequins optional).\n2. Character node: the person's face photo, a full body photo and a voice recording (Load Audio, 5 to 30 s of clear speech, no music). Add more Load Image nodes into face / body / outfit for more photos; chain more Character nodes through 'cast' for more people, or use the Cast list on the Studio (.char / RefMod files, + voice per person).\n   The Character node's text box shows which pictures are used and what looks wrong (no face, blurred, someone else, the same photo twice). Small faces are cropped to the face; nothing is enlarged.\n3. Studio: create = movie. Write the action with quoted speech ('Emma says: \"...\"'), press 'Write the prompt', read it, Run.\n   A voice is only used for someone who speaks: the prompt then says '<Audio 1> is Emma's voice'. Delete that sentence to let H3 invent the voice.\n4. Preview & Save shows the clip (MP4 with sound)."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
